WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.378
Mom had good news.

2
00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:21.202
"We're going to babysit for Martha today."

3
00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:24.222
"Yay!" said Emmy.

4
00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:29.682
"Baby Martha is so cute!"

5
00:00:29.683 --> 00:00:32.969
Soon Martha's mom brought Martha.

6
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:38.127
She brought a diaper bag and crib too.

7
00:00:38.128 --> 00:00:43.042
"I want to play with Martha," Oliver said.

8
00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:46.554
"She is too little," Mom said.

9
00:00:46.555 --> 00:00:50.642
Then Martha started to cry.

10
00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:55.306
"What does she want?" Harry asked.

11
00:00:55.307 --> 00:00:59.251
"She wants a new diaper," said Mom.

12
00:00:59.252 --> 00:01:02.877
Mom got Martha a new diaper.

13
00:01:02.878 --> 00:01:06.220
Martha smiled.

14
00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:09.486
The kids ate lunch.

15
00:01:09.487 --> 00:01:15.846
Martha started to cry again.

16
00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:21.039
"What does she want?" Emmy asked.

17
00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:27.536
"She wants lunch," Mom said.

18
00:01:27.537 --> 00:01:42.297
Emmy gave Martha a bottle.

19
00:01:42.298 --> 00:01:45.617
Martha burped and smiled.

20
00:01:45.618 --> 00:01:49.972
Soon Martha started to cry again.

21
00:01:49.973 --> 00:01:53.818
"What does Martha want?" Harry asked.

22
00:01:53.819 --> 00:01:58.321
"She wants to play," said Oliver.

23
00:01:58.322 --> 00:02:06.358
"She wants a nap," Mom said.

24
00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:12.676
Harry put the baby in her crib.

25
00:02:12.677 --> 00:02:18.016
Martha took a long nap.

26
00:02:18.017 --> 00:02:21.627
Then Martha woke up.

27
00:02:21.628 --> 00:02:25.159
She started to cry.

28
00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:30.844
She was not wet or hungry or tired.

29
00:02:30.845 --> 00:02:34.856
But she was still crying.

30
00:02:34.857 --> 00:02:38.305
Mom didn't know what to do.

31
00:02:38.306 --> 00:02:45.672
"What does Martha want now?" she asked.

32
00:02:45.673 --> 00:02:55.156
"I know!" Oliver ran to his room.

33
00:02:55.157 --> 00:02:59.655
He got his green alligator.

34
00:02:59.656 --> 00:03:06.079
Oliver gave the alligator to Martha.

35
00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.416
She kicked and laughed.

36
00:03:09.417 --> 00:03:12.683
"See, Mom?" Oliver said.

37
00:03:12.684 --> 00:03:18.133
"Martha wants to play!"
